        <obo:IAO_0000115>A steviol glycoside that is steviol in which both the carboxy group and the tertiary allylic hydroxy group have been converted to their corresponding β-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-glucosides. A precious bioactive natural sweetener which mainly exists the in Chinese sweet tea plant, &lt;em&gt;Rubus suavissimus&lt;/em&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
