        <obo:IAO_0000115>A diastereoisomeric mixture composed of 1-&lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;-α-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-glucopyranosyl-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-mannitol dihydrate and 6-&lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;-α-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-glucopyranosyl-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-glucitol in a 1:1 ratio. It is used in the food industry as a sugar substitute and in the pharmaceutical industry as a tabletting excipient.</obo:IAO_0000115>
