        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cinnamate ester obtained by formal condensation of the carboxy group of &lt;em&gt;trans&lt;/em&gt;-caffeic acid with the 3-hydroxy group of quinic acid. It is an intermediate metabolite in the biosynthesis of lignin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
