        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cyclohexenecarboxylic acid that is cyclohex-1-ene-1-carboxylic acid substituted by hydroxy groups at positions 3, 4 and 5 (the 3&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt;,4&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;,5&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt; stereoisomer). It is an intermediate metabolite in plants and microorganisms.</obo:IAO_0000115>
