        <obo:IAO_0000115>A trisaccharide composed of α-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-galactopyranose, α-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-glucopyranose and β-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-fructofuranose joined in sequence by 1→6 and 1↔2 glycosidic linkages, respectively.</obo:IAO_0000115>
