        <obo:IAO_0000115>A monohydroxybenzoic acid that is benzoic acid with a hydroxy group at the &lt;em&gt;ortho&lt;/em&gt; position. It is obtained from the bark of the white willow and wintergreen leaves.</obo:IAO_0000115>
