        <obo:IAO_0000115>A stilbenol that is &lt;i&gt;trans&lt;/i&gt;-stilbene in which one of the phenyl groups is substituted by hydroxy groups at positions 3 and 5, while the other phenyl group is substituted by a hydroxy group at position 3 and a methoxy group at position 4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
