        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fatty acid which has a chain length greater than C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;22&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;. Very long-chain fatty acids which have a chain length greater than C27 are also known as ultra-long-chain fatty acids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
