        <obo:IAO_0000115>An  epoxycarotenol that is β-carotene-3,3&apos;-diol in which one of the one of the endocyclic double bonds has been oxidised to the corresponding epoxide. It is a neutral yellow plant pigment found in &lt;em&gt;Euglenophyta&lt;/em&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
