        <obo:IAO_0000115>A dihydroxyflavanone in which the two hydroxy groups are located at positions 5 and 7. A natural product found in &lt;em&gt;Piper sarmentosum&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Cryptocarya chartacea&lt;/em&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
