        <obo:IAO_0000115>An eremophilane sesquiterpenoid that is (+)-5-&lt;em&gt;epi&lt;/em&gt;-aristolochene bearing additional 1β- and 3α-hydroxy substituents. It is a phytoalexin produced in &lt;em&gt;Nicotiana&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Capsicum&lt;/em&gt; plant species in response to pathogen attack.</obo:IAO_0000115>
