        <obo:IAO_0000115>A C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;18&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; straight-chain saturated fatty acid component of many animal and vegetable lipids. As well as in the diet, it is used in hardening soaps, softening plastics and in making cosmetics, candles and  plastics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
