        <obo:IAO_0000115>A monohydroxybenzoic acid that is benzoic acid substituted by a hydroxy group at position 3. It has been isolated from &lt;em&gt;Taxus baccata&lt;/em&gt;. It is used as an intermediate in the synthesis of plasticisers, resins, pharmaceuticals, etc.</obo:IAO_0000115>
