        <obo:IAO_0000115>An 3β-sterol that is (22&lt;i&gt;E&lt;/i&gt;)-ergosta-5,22-diene substituted by a hydroxy group at position 3β. It is a phytosterol found in marine algae, fish, and rapeseed oil.</obo:IAO_0000115>
