        <obo:IAO_0000115>A  methoxyisoflavone that is isoflavone substituted by a methoxy group at position 6 and hydroxy groups at positions 7 and 4&apos;. It has been isolated from the mycelia of the fungus &lt;em&gt;Cordyceps sinensis&lt;/em&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
