            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;18&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;, straight-chain, unsaturated long-chain fatty acid anion and the conjugate base of its corresponding octadecatrienoic acid, formed by deprotonation of the carboxylic acid group.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>octadecatrienoate</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
