            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The zwitterion formed from taurine by transfer of a proton from the sulfonyl to the amino group.  It is the major species existing at physiological pH.</obo:IAO_0000115>
