        <obo:IAO_0000115>An abietane diterpenoid that is abieta-8,11,13-triene substituted by hydroxy groups at positions 11 and 12 and a carboxy group at position 20. It is isolated from rosemary (&lt;em&gt;Rosmarinus officinalis&lt;/em&gt;) and common sage (&lt;em&gt;Salvia officinalis&lt;/em&gt;) and exhibits anti-angiogenic, antineoplastic, antioxidant and anti-HIV activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
