        <obo:IAO_0000115>A β-diketone that is curcumin in which one of the methoxy groups is replaced by hydrogen. It is found in &lt;em&gt;Curcuma zedoaria&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Etlingera elatior&lt;/em&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
