        <obo:IAO_0000115>A trihydroxyflavone that is flavone with hydroxy groups at positions 5, 7 and 4&apos; and methoxy groups at positions 3&apos; and 6. Isolated from &lt;em&gt;Salvia tomentosa&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Artemisia asiatica&lt;/em&gt;, it exhibits anti-allergic, anti-inflammatory and apoptosis inducing activties.</obo:IAO_0000115>
