        <obo:IAO_0000115>A quercetin &lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;-glycoside that consists of quercetin attached to a β-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-glucuronopyranosyl moiety at position 3 via a glycosidic linkage. Isolated from &lt;em&gt;Salvia&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Phaseolus vulgaris&lt;/em&gt;, it exhibits antioxidant and antidepressant activities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
