        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the class of pterocarpans that is the 3-&lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;-methyl ether of (+)-6a-hydroxymaackiain (the 6a&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt;,12a&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt; stereoisomer). A phytoalexin found in pods of garden peas (&lt;em&gt;Pisum sativum&lt;/em&gt;) and other plants of the pea family, including &lt;em&gt;Tephrosia candida&lt;/em&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
