        <obo:IAO_0000115>A quercetin &lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;-glycoside that is quercetin with a β-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-galactosyl residue attached at position 3. Isolated from &lt;em&gt;Artemisia capillaris&lt;/em&gt;, it exhibits hepatoprotective activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
