        <obo:IAO_0000115>A quercetin &lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;-glucoside that is quercetin with a β-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-glucosyl residue attached at position 3. Isolated from &lt;em&gt;Lepisorus contortus&lt;/em&gt;, it exhibits antineoplastic activityand has been found to decrease the rate of polymerization and sickling of red blood cells</obo:IAO_0000115>
