        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glycosyloxyflavone that consists of myricetin attached to a α-&lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-rhamnopyranosyl residue at position 3 via a glycosidic linkage. Isolated from &lt;em&gt;Myrica cerifera&lt;/em&gt;, it exhibits anti-allergic activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
