        <obo:IAO_0000115>A proanthocyanidin consisting of two molecules of (+)-catechin joined by a bond between positions 4 and 8&apos; in α-configuration. It can be found in red wine, in barley, in beer, in peach or in &lt;em&gt;Jatropha macrantha&lt;/em&gt;, the Huanarpo Macho.</obo:IAO_0000115>
