        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23924"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An enzyme inhibitor which interferes with the action of a lyase (EC 4.*.*.*). Lyases are enzymes cleaving &lt;em&gt;C&lt;/em&gt;‒&lt;em&gt;C&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;C&lt;/em&gt;‒&lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;C&lt;/em&gt;‒&lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt; and other bonds by other means than by hydrolysis or oxidation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
