        <obo:IAO_0000115>A ginsenoside found in &lt;em&gt;Panax&lt;/em&gt; species that is dammarane which is substituted by hydroxy groups at the 3β, 6α, 12β and 20 &lt;em&gt;pro&lt;/em&gt;-&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt; positions, in which the hydroxy group at position 6 has been converted to the corresponding α-&lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-rhamnopyranosyl-(1→2)-β-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-glucopyranoside, and in which a double bond has been introduced at the 24-25 position.</obo:IAO_0000115>
